# Replace the installed Mac app

When you finish a change that belongs in the desktop app (UI, renderer, main, preload, packaging), do not stop at tests or a running `bun run dev` session.

1. Run `bun run update:mac`. That packages an arm64 build and overwrites `~/Applications/Kodi.app`.
2. The install script quits any running Kodi process. That is expected.
3. Do not open the installed app afterward unless the user asked.

Skip this only when the change cannot affect the packaged app (docs-only, rules-only, or the user said not to install).
